<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">League of Cambrai</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1508</span> · <a href="/centuries/16th-century">16th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The League of Cambrai was an alliance formed at Cambrai in December 1508 by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pope-julius-ii">Pope Julius II</a>, Emperor Maximilian I, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/louis-xii-of-france">Louis XII of France</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ferdinand-ii-of-aragon">Ferdinand II of Aragon</a> against the Republic of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/venice">Venice</a>. Its armies crushed the Venetians at Agnadello in 1509, but the allies soon fell out, and Venice recovered most of its mainland territory in the war that followed.</p></div>
